# @hub-lanes

# ── SECRETS APPLY LANE (BH-7965, BH-7937.2) ──────────────────────────────────
# Every minute the hub lists the pending secret envelopes (hub token) and runs
# bin/envelope-consume.sh on each ai-account one: decrypt, prove with the
# vendor, write to the boxes over ssh, confirm. flock -n dedupes. Inert until
# ENVELOPE_HUB_TOKEN is set on the hub. Doc: docs/SECRETS-ENVELOPE.md.
# Off: flags/lane-off-secrets-apply, or bin/harness-ctl.sh off secrets-apply.
* * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/secrets-apply.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
